# P81 on Windows (WinUI): open window B, then ask for a sheet from it. Positions measured 2026-10-20 with test_support/measure/measure_win.zsh (DIPs at 125%): window A open second window (150,153); window B has the same layout, sheet (105,191). The focus row makes window B the frame of reference.
# Pass: the sheet appears over window B and says sheet from window B -- over window A it is the defect P81 exists for.
# P81(Windows,WinUI):開啟視窗 B,從 B 要一個 sheet。通過:sheet 出現在 B 上方並寫著 from window B。
